{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/36466521a1b81f4b29c95017f32cd4ec.avif?t=1693940978\" width=601 height=140 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/2f8fba832cce87a10e62ff143f1285fd.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/2f8fba832cce87a10e62ff143f1285fd.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/2f8fba832cce87a10e62ff143f1285fd.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>According to my best friend Anton:</i> <strong>Wally and the FANTASTIC PREDATORS</strong> is a perma-death rogue-lite where you play as Wally, a predatory fox who is attacking defenseless animals in their own homes and taking all their money. During your decent you also get to experience verbal abuse from various NPCs, but it\u2019s okay because you can hug the backpack guy and that\u2019s fantastic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/42166dc846405950507f8a0c1de7305e.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/42166dc846405950507f8a0c1de7305e.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/42166dc846405950507f8a0c1de7305e.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>That\u2019s right, you were the FANTASTIC PREDATOR all along.<br><br>I think there\u2019s more than 3 levels, but I really can\u2019t be sure as the game is incredibly difficult. Legends speak of legends that manage to beat the Foxlion and get to level 4. From the trailer though there seems to imply more content probably only accessible by about five that made it this far.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/242b4d0dc4ff7ed797e8b396f8525571.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/242b4d0dc4ff7ed797e8b396f8525571.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/242b4d0dc4ff7ed797e8b396f8525571.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Despite being so difficult and me bad at videogames, the game is very fun to play. The game is fast paced and handles very smoothly. Wally always moves like you tell him to and has a very satisfying moveset. There\u2019s a lot of upgrades to pick up that changes the gameplay in various ways, both positive and negative.<br><br><br>The developer is constantly interacting with the community and is very in love<br>with his creation. You can tell a lot of love went into this product. The game is overflowing with charm and details, it\u2019s an absolute recommendation from me.<br><br>End<br><br><strong>Thank you Anton I freaking love you man! Your review is better than anything I could have written!<br>-Oscar Gonzalez</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/6c0ad34baa7c7ffea4715f8a3c2e1dcb.avif?t=1693940978\" width=499 height=379 /></span><br><br><strong>Wally and the FANTASTIC PREDATORS</strong> is a weird game wearing the skin of a traditional rogue-lite.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aac0c9589b6b6734cc3a6a48ac64b477.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aac0c9589b6b6734cc3a6a48ac64b477.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aac0c9589b6b6734cc3a6a48ac64b477.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What sets Wally the game apart is it's <strong>attitude</strong>. Wally is the weird kid in middle school who Naruto runs in between classes. It's weird, wholesome and confident in itself. It's that confidence that is omni-present in pretty much every part of the game.  It's also not afraid of going to extremes in order to make a point or to make a good joke!<br><br>I remember this one time I was really bored and thought, dude wouldn't it be hilarious if we made a dungeon where everything just became the letter A.<br>The enemies, the bullets, every ui element it would be an a and it would be confusing as heck!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/01b0ee32571bfdbf02a7c6932dc541c9.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/01b0ee32571bfdbf02a7c6932dc541c9.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/01b0ee32571bfdbf02a7c6932dc541c9.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Why? Idk I thought it was hilarious lol<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/928239bd6fea6d48458579df7a6931eb.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=250 /></span><br><br>To keep every day extra spicy we add unique twists in dailiy runs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aec974df31c1483faa4f192541d78279.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aec974df31c1483faa4f192541d78279.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aec974df31c1483faa4f192541d78279.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Twists can be things like have a 50% of throwing a bonus bomb or start a run in a glass cannon mode, or applying some strong buff such as a CRIT to all weapons in the dungeon. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/af485a46b35168170a2e4346dfb046b7.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/af485a46b35168170a2e4346dfb046b7.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/af485a46b35168170a2e4346dfb046b7.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Inspired by <strong>Binding of Isaac's</strong> infinite synergies combinations, you start a run with a wimpy weapon, over time you find passive items, curses, weapons, quests that permanently change the rules of a single play sessions session (such as getting a curse that makes every bomb shoot a fireball at your face whenever they explode). Dying resets everything giving each run a completely unique experience. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/3f601745a9f7f465721014b798ef1398.avif?t=1693940978\" width=601 height=140 /></span><br>There is also a COOP mode where you can torture your friends by making them play with you, it's local only so you only need one copy! (Not because I'm generous, it's just that I just that I have no idea how to netcode lol)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/889588670e742726e31f557066dc86c5.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/889588670e742726e31f557066dc86c5.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/889588670e742726e31f557066dc86c5.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/c5ec1823b7595bbc53d84e21cc180776.avif?t=1693940978\" width=601 height=140 /></span><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Daily Twists</strong>, These Daily/Weekly runs we introduce crazy twists every day! Start one daily run with maximum movement speed or start a run over encumbered with bombs. Compete with 600+ members of our discord community!<br></li><li>Local <strong>COOP </strong>which means you only need one copy of Wally to enjoy with a friend!<br></li><li>10 <strong>Dungeons</strong><br></li><li><strong>150+</strong> different Upgrades/Curses/Weapons/Quests/Daily Twists. With so many stack able passives interacting with each other it'll take years to see every combination.<br></li><li>Hugging Simulator <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/914f37826434257f7cf0236fa680fa8a.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/914f37826434257f7cf0236fa680fa8a.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/914f37826434257f7cf0236fa680fa8a.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>5 Single Player Run types<br></li><li>5 Boss fights that will make you say, WHAT THE HECK IS THAT<br></li><li>Branching paths, get as greedy as much as you want, do you want to trade all your max health and become a glass cannon? Why the heck not!<br></li><li>True Ending, (It's a mystery to everyone what it is)</li></ul></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/4affeaffc056e48c3713977715e527f9.avif?t=1693940978\" width=614 height=234 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4a0a2886477b3a4ede31a88e03ac544129518373.jpg","localized_name":"WE'RE DONE HERE!","name":"WE'RE DONE HERE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/4a0a2886477b3a4ede31a88e03ac544129518373.jpg"},{"icon":"38a3c1c24539f9eb897b44effa2f419427a00324.jpg","localized_name":"BEST DAY EVER!","name":"BEST DAY EVER!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/38a3c1c24539f9eb897b44effa2f419427a00324.jpg"},{"icon":"448bc0b92e3e2de971b8bc4d48c2fa0ea7c96e85.jpg","localized_name":"I BEAT THE FLOOR IS LAVA AND ALL I GOT WAS THIS STEAM ACHIEVEMENT!","name":"I BEAT THE FLOOR IS LAVA AND ALL I GOT WAS THIS STEAM ACHIEVEMENT!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/448bc0b92e3e2de971b8bc4d48c2fa0ea7c96e85.jpg"},{"icon":"0a63fd4b1eb1647d3d03e4a0d1bba983e55755b2.jpg","localized_name":"FOXLION BUT DEAD","name":"FOXLION BUT DEAD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/0a63fd4b1eb1647d3d03e4a0d1bba983e55755b2.jpg"},{"icon":"8b188628e443e348045d56efbcda52e7e3ea92b4.jpg","localized_name":"DID THE THING","name":"DID THE THING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/8b188628e443e348045d56efbcda52e7e3ea92b4.jpg"},{"icon":"d87e078e9fbee22868bc3abbc907e4a226c3fda1.jpg","localized_name":"THE COOLER WHAT NOW?","name":"THE COOLER WHAT NOW?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/d87e078e9fbee22868bc3abbc907e4a226c3fda1.jpg"},{"icon":"dcbf9f7c4f5fae3b9a7cb112a8a4d4caef9334a7.jpg","localized_name":"HELP I'M FALLING!","name":"HELP I'M FALLING!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/dcbf9f7c4f5fae3b9a7cb112a8a4d4caef9334a7.jpg"},{"icon":"bf9e600799e2bad8dae2e462c4c9b3d78497d478.jpg","localized_name":"BLINK IF YOU ARE OK","name":"BLINK IF YOU ARE OK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/bf9e600799e2bad8dae2e462c4c9b3d78497d478.jpg"},{"icon":"4948b120bbc30ec2cfceffd203674e89159a2991.jpg","localized_name":"Wally","name":"Wally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/4948b120bbc30ec2cfceffd203674e89159a2991.jpg"},{"icon":"acce2a4418476d723fb79d0c600f6fcf56833414.jpg","localized_name":"It's an honor to make games for you","name":"It's an honor to make games for you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077450/acce2a4418476d723fb79d0c600f6fcf56833414.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1077450?t=1693940978","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1693940978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1693940978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1693940978","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/36466521a1b81f4b29c95017f32cd4ec.avif?t=1693940978\" width=601 height=140 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/2f8fba832cce87a10e62ff143f1285fd.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/2f8fba832cce87a10e62ff143f1285fd.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/2f8fba832cce87a10e62ff143f1285fd.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>According to my best friend Anton:</i> <strong>Wally and the FANTASTIC PREDATORS</strong> is a perma-death rogue-lite where you play as Wally, a predatory fox who is attacking defenseless animals in their own homes and taking all their money. During your decent you also get to experience verbal abuse from various NPCs, but it\u2019s okay because you can hug the backpack guy and that\u2019s fantastic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/42166dc846405950507f8a0c1de7305e.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/42166dc846405950507f8a0c1de7305e.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/42166dc846405950507f8a0c1de7305e.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>That\u2019s right, you were the FANTASTIC PREDATOR all along.<br><br>I think there\u2019s more than 3 levels, but I really can\u2019t be sure as the game is incredibly difficult. Legends speak of legends that manage to beat the Foxlion and get to level 4. From the trailer though there seems to imply more content probably only accessible by about five that made it this far.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/242b4d0dc4ff7ed797e8b396f8525571.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/242b4d0dc4ff7ed797e8b396f8525571.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/242b4d0dc4ff7ed797e8b396f8525571.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Despite being so difficult and me bad at videogames, the game is very fun to play. The game is fast paced and handles very smoothly. Wally always moves like you tell him to and has a very satisfying moveset. There\u2019s a lot of upgrades to pick up that changes the gameplay in various ways, both positive and negative.<br><br><br>The developer is constantly interacting with the community and is very in love<br>with his creation. You can tell a lot of love went into this product. The game is overflowing with charm and details, it\u2019s an absolute recommendation from me.<br><br>End<br><br><strong>Thank you Anton I freaking love you man! Your review is better than anything I could have written!<br>-Oscar Gonzalez</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/6c0ad34baa7c7ffea4715f8a3c2e1dcb.avif?t=1693940978\" width=499 height=379 /></span><br><br><strong>Wally and the FANTASTIC PREDATORS</strong> is a weird game wearing the skin of a traditional rogue-lite.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aac0c9589b6b6734cc3a6a48ac64b477.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aac0c9589b6b6734cc3a6a48ac64b477.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aac0c9589b6b6734cc3a6a48ac64b477.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What sets Wally the game apart is it's <strong>attitude</strong>. Wally is the weird kid in middle school who Naruto runs in between classes. It's weird, wholesome and confident in itself. It's that confidence that is omni-present in pretty much every part of the game.  It's also not afraid of going to extremes in order to make a point or to make a good joke!<br><br>I remember this one time I was really bored and thought, dude wouldn't it be hilarious if we made a dungeon where everything just became the letter A.<br>The enemies, the bullets, every ui element it would be an a and it would be confusing as heck!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/01b0ee32571bfdbf02a7c6932dc541c9.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/01b0ee32571bfdbf02a7c6932dc541c9.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/01b0ee32571bfdbf02a7c6932dc541c9.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Why? Idk I thought it was hilarious lol<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/928239bd6fea6d48458579df7a6931eb.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=250 /></span><br><br>To keep every day extra spicy we add unique twists in dailiy runs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aec974df31c1483faa4f192541d78279.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aec974df31c1483faa4f192541d78279.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/aec974df31c1483faa4f192541d78279.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Twists can be things like have a 50% of throwing a bonus bomb or start a run in a glass cannon mode, or applying some strong buff such as a CRIT to all weapons in the dungeon. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/af485a46b35168170a2e4346dfb046b7.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/af485a46b35168170a2e4346dfb046b7.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/af485a46b35168170a2e4346dfb046b7.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Inspired by <strong>Binding of Isaac's</strong> infinite synergies combinations, you start a run with a wimpy weapon, over time you find passive items, curses, weapons, quests that permanently change the rules of a single play sessions session (such as getting a curse that makes every bomb shoot a fireball at your face whenever they explode). Dying resets everything giving each run a completely unique experience. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/3f601745a9f7f465721014b798ef1398.avif?t=1693940978\" width=601 height=140 /></span><br>There is also a COOP mode where you can torture your friends by making them play with you, it's local only so you only need one copy! (Not because I'm generous, it's just that I just that I have no idea how to netcode lol)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/889588670e742726e31f557066dc86c5.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/889588670e742726e31f557066dc86c5.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/889588670e742726e31f557066dc86c5.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/c5ec1823b7595bbc53d84e21cc180776.avif?t=1693940978\" width=601 height=140 /></span><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Daily Twists</strong>, These Daily/Weekly runs we introduce crazy twists every day! Start one daily run with maximum movement speed or start a run over encumbered with bombs. Compete with 600+ members of our discord community!<br></li><li>Local <strong>COOP </strong>which means you only need one copy of Wally to enjoy with a friend!<br></li><li>10 <strong>Dungeons</strong><br></li><li><strong>150+</strong> different Upgrades/Curses/Weapons/Quests/Daily Twists. With so many stack able passives interacting with each other it'll take years to see every combination.<br></li><li>Hugging Simulator <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/914f37826434257f7cf0236fa680fa8a.poster.avif?t=1693940978\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/914f37826434257f7cf0236fa680fa8a.webm?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/914f37826434257f7cf0236fa680fa8a.mp4?t=1693940978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>5 Single Player Run types<br></li><li>5 Boss fights that will make you say, WHAT THE HECK IS THAT<br></li><li>Branching paths, get as greedy as much as you want, do you want to trade all your max health and become a glass cannon? Why the heck not!<br></li><li>True Ending, (It's a mystery to everyone what it is)</li></ul></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/extras/4affeaffc056e48c3713977715e527f9.avif?t=1693940978\" width=614 height=234 /></span>","developers":["Oscar Gonzalez"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077450/header.jpg?t=1693940978","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04 LTS or newer, Intel/AMD 64-Bit ONLY<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Processor: Dual Core 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Must support OpenGL 3 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Intel/AMD 64-Bit ONLY</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.11 El Capitan or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 64-Bit or Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any Mac newer than 2015 should work<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1077450/476166/9296e085e031fca2d0e062b7a01b0e3a088eac5e/1751185310/dash_av1.mpd?t=1656892088","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1077450/476166/9296e085e031fca2d0e062b7a01b0e3a088eac5e/1751185310/dash_h264.mpd?t=1656892088","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1077450/476166/9296e085e031fca2d0e062b7a01b0e3a088eac5e/1751185310/h